#   doorway-page pattern this project has repeatedly rejected.
# - ewastekochi-amp.html: contains unverified claims ("most trusted," "Government
#   authorized" stated as fact) that don't meet this project's anti-fabrication rules.
# - Homepage Hero image.png: the source file for a hero graphic already reviewed and
#   rejected for the same reason (fabricated rating, named client logos).
# - GSC export zips: one-time data inputs already fully extracted into data/*.json;
#   the useful content is in version control via those files, not the raw zips.
